{
  "id": "apex_telemetry",
  "title": "Apex Telemetry",
  "description": "A GT3 pit board on the center screen: tyre pressures and temperatures against the car's targets, boost against its target, fuel pressures, engine load, gearbox and outside temperatures, range and g-force",
